What:		/sys/class/power_supply/ltc3350/charge_status
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	Mike Looijmans <mike.looijmans@topic.nl>
Description:
		Reports the raw CHRG_STATUS register as a hexadecimal bit mask.
		Bits 0 and 1 indicate step-down and step-up operation, respectively;
		bit 2 indicates constant-voltage charging, bit 3 undervoltage
		lockout, bit 4 input current limiting, bit 5 capacitor power good,
		bits 6 and 7 shunting and balancing, bit 8 charging disabled for
		capacitance measurement, bit 9 constant-current charging, and
		bit 11 input power failure.
		Access: Read
